<BlogPost title="Privacy Policy" description="How we handle the data of people who visit Colombia Force." pubDate={new Date('2026-09-23')}>
  <p>Colombia Force respects your privacy. This site does not require registration and does not directly collect personal data.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and third-party services</h2>
  <p>We use, or may use, third-party tools such as Google Analytics and Google AdSense. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>, and learn how Google uses data in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">this page</a>. You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>Our articles link to official sources and other sites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The current version will always be on this page.</p>
</BlogPost>
